## 16. Snowflake vs BigQuery vs Redshift vs Databricks

| Feature | Snowflake | BigQuery | Redshift | Databricks |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Deployment | Multi-cloud | GCP only | AWS only | Multi-cloud |
| Compute model | Virtual warehouses | Serverless slots | Cluster-based | Spark clusters |
| Storage separation | Full | Full | Partial | Full (with Delta) |
| Streaming ingestion | Snowpipe | Native streaming | Kinesis Firehose | Spark Streaming |
| ML built-in | Cortex ML | BigQuery ML | None | MLflow/MLlib |
| Natural language | Cortex Analyst | Gemini SQL | None | AI/BI Genie |
| Best for | Analytics, multi-cloud | GCP-native analytics | AWS data warehouse | ML pipelines, lakehouse |
| Pricing | Per-credit compute | Per-query bytes | Per-node-hour | Per-DBU |

